  "baselines": [
    "Exact source baseline at baseline.json WDBX HEAD using existing kernel and fixed seed; build failures are recorded, never assigned score zero.",
    "Composition: top one extractive source (no joined facts) and fixed current-engine decoder; compare both, not the weaker one only.",
    "Retrieval: pure cosine ranking with identical frozen candidate IDs, vectors, storage and count; shared tenant authorization and cryptographic rejection. Equal memory/time caps; dimension-aware ranker must not win by more candidates.",
    "Language: existing normalization/bind pipeline. Vision: existing native analyze/renderer CPU reference, plus untransformed input for instruction tests. Supervision: existing review; mutation: no-mutation and current mutation."
  ],
  "analysis": "Freeze commit and reviewer signoff before efficacy execution. Developer sees train only; independent runner holds test and oracle artifact, uses family-level splits (all variants stay together). Validation may select <=5 candidates after <=20 train configurations; choose one before test. Seeds paired across alternatives; report per-suite denominator, timeout/abstention/error as failure. Compute 10000 family-cluster paired bootstrap resamples with seed 104729; lower two-sided 95% CI of gain must be strictly >0 and point gains meet thresholds. For bounded safety constraints every case must pass; zero observed errors is not universal proof. No pooling suites to hide regression. Require nonzero baseline failure denominator for relative retrieval gains; otherwise inconclusive, not pass. Correction/proposal precision also require recall>=0.8; abstention cannot game precision. Mutation novelty requires distinct from either source and semantic oracle pass. Latency median/p95 and max memory recorded, no more than 2x baseline p95 and within case timeout. Immutable hashes before/after prove no training from calls.",
  "oracle_review": "Synthetic structured oracles are reproducible structural checks, not a natural language efficacy certification. Independent reviewer verifies arithmetic/constraint/shape labels and blind-scores all held-out composition/tone/mutation outputs with two raters, adjudicating disagreement; preserve ratings. Vision OCR requires rasterize the given equation in an independently frozen font+renderer artifact before experiments; no OCR claims until that artifact is pinned. Current rectangular corpus cannot establish general visual or arbitrary-language efficacy. Expansion requires new corpus version, preregistration and independent holdout; never retune this test.",
  "result_schema": [
    "protocol_digest",
    "implementation_commit",
    "dirty_paths",
    "artifact_hash",
    "platform",
    "backend_executed",
